-- DESCRIPTION --

1. Boulder
- Type: Implements Drawable only (Does NOT extend GamePiece).
- Behavior: Is an obstacle element on the board. 
Does not interact with the player; does not move.

2. Medusa
- Extends GamePiece.
- InteractionResult: KILL
- Behavior: Stationary piece. Interacts at a distance (kills the player 
if the player gets within 2 spaces of Medusa).

3. Minotaur
 - Type: Extends GamePiece
- InteractionResult: ADVANCE
 - Behavior: Stationary piece. Interacts at a distance (advances player to the next level if within 1 space).

4. Soldier
- Type: Extends GamePiece, Implements Moveable
- InteractionResult: NONE
- Behavior: Moves in one direction, one tile at a time.

5. Spectre
- Type: Extends GamePiece, Implements Moveable.
- InteractionResult: NONE
- Behavior: Uses random movement to move around the board.

6. Treasure
- Type: Extends GamePiece
- InteractionResult: GET_POINT
- Behavior: Stationary piece. Awards the player a point when landed on square

7. Wasp
- Type: Extends GamePiece.
- InteractionResult: HIT
- Behavior: Hits player if player steps on it.
